sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant B as Bank Agent (leader)
    participant I as Informations Agent
    participant A as Actions Agent

    Note over B: Startup: one A2A client per agent URL<br/>src/server.ts:14, no network call yet

    rect rgba(127,127,127,0.08)
    Note over C,I: Case 1 - read data (first call also discovers the agent)
    C->>B: "Quel est mon solde ?"
    Note over B: Model calls ask_informations_agent<br/>src/agent/tools/remoteAgents.ts:33
    opt First call to this agent
        B->>I: GET /.well-known/agent-card.json
        I-->>B: Agent Card (url, JSONRPC, version 1.0, skills)
        Note over B: Transport picked from the card, client cached<br/>src/a2a/remoteAgent.ts:162
    end
    B->>I: SendMessage (text, metadata.client_id, contextId)
    I-->>B: Task completed + answer artifact
    B-->>C: Answer in the client's language
    end

    rect rgba(127,127,127,0.08)
    Note over C,A: Case 2 - operation with confirmation
    C->>B: "Block my card 4821"
    Note over B: Model calls ask_actions_agent<br/>src/agent/tools/remoteAgents.ts:61
    B->>A: SendMessage (text, client_id, contextId)
    A-->>B: Task input-required + summary
    Note over B: taskId stored as pendingConfirmation<br/>src/agent/bankAgent.ts:315
    B-->>C: Summary + Approve / Reject buttons
    C->>B: confirmation { decision: approve }
    B->>A: SendMessage (same taskId, data { decision })
    A-->>B: Task completed + answer artifact
    B-->>C: "Votre carte est bloquée."
    end
